<title>USA: Novel Denim IPO shares increased - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Novel Denim IPO shares increased - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of shares in Novel Denim Holdings Ltd's initial public offering has been raised to 4.25 million from 3.75 million, according to underwriter Morgan Stanley Dean Witter.</p>
<p>The expected price range remained unchanged at $15 to $17 a share.</p>
<p>The company, a Kowloon, Hong Kong-based supplier of denim garments and fabric, is scheduled to make its debut on the Nasdaq on Thursday.</p>
</text>
